# =================================================================
# 项目名称: Python / Flutter / Web 通用忽略配置
# 严谨性要求：仅过滤构建噪声，严禁污染源码库
# =================================================================

# --- 虚拟环境 (Virtual Environments) ---
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
Include/
Lib/
Scripts/
pyvenv.cfg

# --- 构建产物 (Build Outputs) ---
# 递归忽略所有层级的 build 目录
**/build/
dist/
bin/
obj/
out/
*.spec

# --- Python 编译缓存 (Python Cache) ---
# 严格禁止字节码文件进入版本库
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# --- IDE & 编辑器 (IDE Settings) ---
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.swp
.classpath
.project
.settings/

# --- 操作系统临时文件 (OS Metadata) ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# --- 日志与测试数据 (Logs & Data) ---
*.log
*.tmp
temp/

# --- 针对 Flutter 的特定忽略 (如适用) ---
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.packages
.pub-cache/
.pub/
logo.ico
test_app_automation.py
test_pages_automation.py
出厂质检报告_delivery_report.md
